# Phase 6 natural transfer slice (docs/data_plan_v0.4.md §10).
#
# Bulk downloads and fetched full texts are never committed: the catalogue
# archive alone is ~126 MB, and the per-book texts are reproducible from
# Project Gutenberg by rerunning scripts/build_transfer_slice.py. What IS
# worth committing is the small, reviewable output -- the selection, the
# manifest, and the realized-distribution report, since those are what a
# reader needs to audit the slice's skew and its contamination status.

# Cached bulk downloads and intermediates
cache/

# Built slice payloads (regenerate with scripts/build_transfer_slice.py)
*/records.jsonl
*/selection.json

# Keep the auditable artifacts
!*/manifest.json
!*/distribution_report.txt
!*/distribution_report.json
